{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ redirected too many times": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ terlalu sering mengalihkan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ took too long to respond": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ terlalu lama merespons"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ uses a separate profile, so this tab may be signed out of any sites it is logged in to.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ memakai profil terpisah, jadi tab ini mungkin keluar dari situs yang sedang masuk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ — profile “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ — profil “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld Minutes": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld Menit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld agents connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld agen terhubung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld entries were skipped. Is this a Netscape-format bookmarks export?": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld entri dilewati. Apakah ini ekspor markah berformat Netscape?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld entries will be skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld entri akan dilewati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld hidden": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld disembunyikan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld run a background worker in this Space": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld dari %lld menjalankan pekerja latar belakang di Space ini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld results match “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld hasil cocok dengan “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld script errors": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld galat skrip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 agent connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 agen terhubung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 result matches “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 hasil cocok dengan “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 script error": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 galat skrip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Space keeps its own tabs, pins and sign-ins. Give this one a name and a colour.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setiap Space punya tab, sematan, dan sesi masuknya sendiri. Beri yang ini nama dan warna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A blank page, your search engine, or a page you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halaman kosong, mesin pencari Anda, atau halaman pilihan Anda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule covers the domain and its subdomains, and beats the setting above. Set a site to “Default” to keep its own referrer while everywhere else is stripped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aturan berlaku untuk domain dan subdomainnya, dan mengalahkan pengaturan di atas. Atur situs ke “Default” agar referrer-nya tetap dikirim sementara di tempat lain dihapus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule covers the domain and its subdomains, and beats the setting above. Set a site to “Default” to keep your own User-Agent there while everywhere else is overridden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aturan berlaku untuk domain dan subdomainnya, dan mengalahkan pengaturan di atas. Atur situs ke “Default” agar User-Agent Anda sendiri dipakai di sana sementara di tempat lain diganti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access on all sites": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Akses di semua situs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activate Stop to end screen sharing": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktifkan Berhenti untuk mengakhiri berbagi layar"
