            "value": "Diimpor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the File menu: Import Bookmarks… (an HTML export from any browser), Import from Arc…, and Import Passwords… (Chrome, Brave, Edge).": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Di menu File: Impor Markah… (ekspor HTML dari peramban apa pun), Impor dari Arc…, dan Impor Kata Sandi… (Chrome, Brave, Edge)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Periksa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect and clear the cookies one site holds in the current Space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Periksa dan hapus cookie yang disimpan satu situs di Space saat ini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install from the Chrome Web Store or a .crx/.xpi, then enable, disable, or uninstall.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasang dari Chrome Web Store atau berkas .crx/.xpi, lalu aktifkan, nonaktifkan, atau copot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items that will be skipped (arc://, extensions, files, and broken URLs): %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Item yang akan dilewati (arc://, ekstensi, berkas, dan URL rusak): %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its tabs, cookies, and cached data are removed permanently.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tab, cookie, dan data cache-nya dihapus secara permanen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JavaScript": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JavaScript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last media error: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Galat media terakhir: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave empty to use the browser's own User-Agent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kosongkan untuk memakai User-Agent bawaan peramban."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let AI agents on this Mac connect to Chord over a private socket.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izinkan agen AI di Mac ini terhubung ke Chord melalui soket privat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let agents run JavaScript": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izinkan agen menjalankan JavaScript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets AI agents on this Mac, such as Claude Code, use Chord in the Spaces you pick below. Only agents started on this Mac can connect, and nothing goes over the network. Agents never get passwords or cookies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mengizinkan agen AI di Mac ini, seperti Claude Code, memakai Chord di Space yang Anda pilih di bawah. Hanya agen yang dijalankan di Mac ini yang dapat terhubung, dan tidak ada yang dikirim lewat jaringan. Agen tidak pernah mendapat kata sandi atau cookie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets agents run their own JavaScript in Read & Act Spaces. Chord shows you each script and asks before it runs. Scripts run apart from the page's own code and can't read cookies, site storage or password fields, but they can read anything else on the page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mengizinkan agen menjalankan JavaScript mereka sendiri di Space Baca & Bertindak. Chord menampilkan setiap skrip dan bertanya sebelum menjalankannya. Skrip berjalan terpisah dari kode halaman dan tidak dapat membaca cookie, penyimpanan situs, atau kolom kata sandi, tetapi dapat membaca hal lain di halaman."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Links from other apps will open here. macOS asks you to confirm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tautan dari aplikasi lain akan dibuka di sini. macOS meminta Anda mengonfirmasi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local Agents (MCP)": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agen Lokal (MCP)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
