          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mati"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On, tabs you can't see stop running a few minutes after they are hidden, as in Safari. Music keeps playing. Off by default: on this macOS a suspended tab can keep the window drawing, which costs more battery than the tabs save.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jika aktif, tab yang tidak terlihat berhenti berjalan beberapa menit setelah disembunyikan, seperti di Safari. Musik tetap diputar. Mati secara default: di macOS ini tab yang ditangguhkan bisa membuat jendela terus menggambar, yang menghabiskan baterai lebih banyak daripada yang dihemat tab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only HTTPS logins with a username are kept; file:, extension:, and plain-HTTP entries are refused. The database was read from a private temporary copy, which has already been deleted. Nothing is written until you click Import.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hanya login HTTPS dengan nama pengguna yang disimpan; entri file:, extension:, dan HTTP biasa ditolak. Basis data dibaca dari salinan sementara privat yang sudah dihapus. Tidak ada yang ditulis sampai Anda mengeklik Impor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
