    "Private windows do not keep a Space, and imports write into the profile. Open a normal window and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jendela pribadi tidak menyimpan Space, dan impor menulis ke profil. Buka jendela biasa dan coba lagi."
