    "Read": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baca"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read & Act": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baca & Bertindak"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read lets an agent list tabs, read pages and take screenshots. Read & Act also lets it open tabs, navigate, click and type; Chord asks you before it signs in, submits a form that sends data, or clicks anything that reads like buying, paying, sending or deleting. It can never type into password fields. Pages can try to give an agent instructions, so a Space with your bank or email is best left Off. Private Spaces are never shared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baca mengizinkan agen melihat daftar tab, membaca halaman, dan mengambil tangkapan layar. Baca & Bertindak juga mengizinkannya membuka tab, bernavigasi, mengeklik, dan mengetik; Chord bertanya kepada Anda sebelum agen masuk ke akun, mengirim formulir yang mengirim data, atau mengeklik apa pun yang terbaca seperti membeli, membayar, mengirim, atau menghapus. Agen tidak pernah bisa mengetik di kolom kata sandi. Halaman bisa mencoba memberi instruksi kepada agen, jadi Space berisi bank atau email Anda sebaiknya dibiarkan Mati. Space pribadi tidak pernah dibagikan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
