            "value": "Tangguhkan hanya saat Chord disembunyikan atau diminimalkan (eksperimental)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe right closes a tab with no back history": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usap ke kanan menutup tab yang tidak punya riwayat mundur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe right on a page that has nothing to undo — it closes the tab (or the Little Chord panel). Turn this off to restore WebKit's default, where the swipe just does nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usap ke kanan pada halaman yang tidak punya langkah mundur — tab (atau panel Little Chord) akan ditutup. Matikan untuk mengembalikan perilaku default WebKit, yaitu usapan tidak melakukan apa-apa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe right on a page with no back history to close the tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usap ke kanan pada halaman tanpa riwayat mundur untuk menutup tab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tab closed": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tab ditutup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tab"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs keep running while a Chord window is on screen, and stop when none is. Not measured yet: if the fans or battery get worse after you bring Chord back, turn it off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tab tetap berjalan selama ada jendela Chord di layar, dan berhenti saat tidak ada. Belum diukur: jika kipas atau baterai memburuk setelah Chord ditampilkan lagi, matikan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That does not look like a domain — try example.com.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Itu tidak terlihat seperti domain — coba example.com."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That does not look like a domain, or reads as a host without a dot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Itu tidak terlihat seperti domain, atau terbaca sebagai host tanpa titik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That element is not on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elemen itu tidak ada di %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a regular file. Choose the “Login Data” file itself. Nothing was imported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
