    "The extension subsystem is not available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subsistem ekstensi tidak tersedia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file could not be opened. If it is in another browser's folder, choose it again and allow access. Nothing was imported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Berkas tidak dapat dibuka. Jika berada di folder peramban lain, pilih lagi dan izinkan akses. Tidak ada yang diimpor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is SQLite, but it has no Chromium logins table. Nothing was imported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Berkasnya SQLite, tetapi tidak punya tabel login Chromium. Tidak ada yang diimpor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is larger than any real Login Data database, so Chord refused to copy it. Nothing was imported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Berkas lebih besar dari basis data Login Data mana pun yang wajar, jadi Chord menolak menyalinnya. Tidak ada yang diimpor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is readable, but it holds no Spaces to import.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Berkas bisa dibaca, tetapi tidak berisi Space untuk diimpor."
