    "Website data is cleared for every Space. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data situs web dihapus untuk semua Space. Tindakan ini tidak dapat dibatalkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Chord": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selamat Datang di Chord"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What address a site is told you came from, plus per-site exceptions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alamat asal yang diberitahukan ke situs, beserta pengecualian per situs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What address a site is told you came from. “Strip” sends no referrer at all — useful on sites that leak the page you were on. Takes effect on the next page load.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alamat asal yang diberitahukan ke situs. “Strip” tidak mengirim referrer sama sekali — berguna di situs yang membocorkan halaman asal Anda. Berlaku saat halaman dimuat berikutnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this browser's engine and display chain can actually play. Answers “can’t do it” vs “Netflix won’t serve it”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apa yang benar-benar bisa diputar mesin peramban dan rantai layar ini. Menjawab “tidak bisa” versus “Netflix tidak mau menyajikannya”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the saved-password vault locks; filling then asks for Touch ID.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kapan brankas kata sandi terkunci; setelah itu pengisian meminta Touch ID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the address bar and command bar send what you type.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ke mana bilah alamat dan bilah perintah mengirim yang Anda ketik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether agents may run their own JavaScript in a page, asked every time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apakah agen boleh menjalankan JavaScript mereka sendiri di halaman, ditanyakan setiap kali."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which Spaces an agent may read, and which it may also act in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space mana yang boleh dibaca agen, dan di mana agen juga boleh bertindak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which browser saved these passwords?": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Peramban mana yang menyimpan kata sandi ini?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You denied the agent’s %@ on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anda menolak %@ oleh agen di %@"
